title: Act_III_Reunion
tags:
---
Mind: Heart! My goodness, I thought I’d lost you!

Heart: I thought I’d lost you too! I was so scared, s-so scared...

Mind: I know, I know. But we’re together again now, and that’s what matters, and we made it out alright!

Heart: What did you see down there?

Mind: 3 Mementos, each of them very vauge. I think they were from the past, but I can’t be sure. I think they were from the past, but I can’t be sure. 

Heart: I saw them too! You're right, they were vague, but it was definitely from the past.

Heart: But... I don’t think they were from our past, Mind. They felt like they were from someone else’s past.

<<NextScene SceneScriptHolder>>

// Mind: This whole thing is terrifying, Heart. I don’t know what’s going on, let us forget this adventure and go home.

// Heart: I don’t think we can, Mind. I think we have to keep going, and find out what’s going on. You owe it to yourself, and I owe it to you.

// Mind: I... don’t know, Heart. We could get seperated again, and I don’t want to lose you again, I... I can’t bear the thought of it. I can’t bear the thought of losing you again.

// Heart: But we <b>have to<b> keep going. Otherwise, you'd never get home, and this place won't have a ruler. It would fall apart without you.

// Mind: ...okay. I'll trust that you'll get me through this. Not like I have a choice, right? You... are really stubborn, you know that?

// Heart: And proud of it!
